-- Hand-written: Rebuild PDF: rebuild requests and results append-only, a request names a subject that may be rebuilt now with its recorded key, the next number, the new and served keys, a result belongs to its request, and a redacted offer's rebuilt PDFs go to the R2 outbox, generated by scripts/write-triggers.ts from src/triggers.ts.
